00:09:50,318 --> 00:09:57,316
On high level, Sapings is a search-based multi-object test generation approach for system-level mobile app testing.

75
00:09:58,446 --> 00:10:06,340
It runs on the release app, so we don't need the source code and we don't need any pre-existing specification or human written task.

76
