The only R code it checks is the app should not crash or should should stop responding.

77
00:10:13,966 --> 00:10:22,052
It's in the original paper, we deploy it after release, but later we gradually by moving to early stage for preventing bugs.

78
00:10:22,766 --> 00:10:32,336
And if you check the loop we mentioned earlier, there are three items explore, observe, and report are well covered in the original paper.

