81
00:10:44,878 --> 00:10:49,668
So you might be familiar with the random fuzzers, which is efficient at bug finding.

82
00:10:50,446 --> 00:10:56,580
And 10 years ago, there is a state of practice called Android Monkey, which is very popular for crash finding.

83
00:10:56,974 --> 00:11:03,492
