00:19:44,494 --> 00:20:04,080
So given a crash data, the sappings uh full triage process would go through the bug stack trace, the crash stack trace, and then allocate the first broken build and the last good build, and all the diffs in between are considered as suspicious diff.

154
00:20:04,974 --> 00:20:13,860
And then we rank those diffs against the crash stack trace frames and pick the most suspicious one and uh triarc that to the developers.

