00:22:14,798 --> 00:22:21,252
And the third, we also check if there are any new crashes introduced by fixing the targeted crash.

174
00:22:21,806 --> 00:22:32,132
And finally, for functional correctness, we rely on historical like pre-existing developer-defined entrance tasks to validate there's any correctness errors.

